<TITLE>Steering Gear</TITLE>
<LIST1 TYPE = "UNORDERED"><ITEM><PTXT>As before, a lightweight, compact rack &amp; pinion type steering gear with excellent operability is used on models with the 2GR-FE engine.</PTXT></ITEM>
<ITEM><PTXT>The housing is a one-piece aluminum part to reduce weight.</PTXT></ITEM>
<ITEM><PTXT>The steering gear is mounted directly to the front suspension member, ensuring steering rigidity.</PTXT></ITEM></LIST1>
